			// photo when one was picked, else the bundled one. A stylesheet cannot
			// read storage, so the choice travels as a custom property the script
			// keeps in step. The layer is fixed to the WINDOW, not the document:
			// a body background sizes against the whole scrolled height, which on
			// a long page turns a landscape photo into a tall slice that never
